WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:16.197
Mr. Gomez: I see three seats in the front row.

2
00:00:16.198 --> 00:00:18.863
Jenna: Wow! Look at that stage!

3
00:00:18.864 --> 00:00:24.741
Jenna: I can't wait to see Daisy dance.

4
00:00:24.742 --> 00:00:30.081
Mrs. Gomez: Oh good. The show's about to start!

5
00:00:30.082 --> 00:00:32.782
Woman: Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.

6
00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:35.755
Woman: Welcome to our Winter Dance Show.

7
00:00:35.756 --> 00:01:08.002
Woman: Our first performer tonight will be Daisy Gomez!

8
00:01:08.003 --> 00:01:11.205
Mr. Gomez: That was a great show, honey.

9
00:01:11.206 --> 00:01:14.077
Mrs. Gomez: You were wonderful.

10
00:01:14.078 --> 00:01:16.429
Jenna: I liked your dance the best.

11
00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:23.401
Miss Gray: Daisy!

12
00:01:23.402 --> 00:01:27.614
Daisy: Miss Gray! What are you doing here?

13
00:01:27.615 --> 00:01:30.689
Miss Gray: I came to see you dance, of course.

14
00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.067
Jenna: Did you see her dance?

15
00:01:33.068 --> 00:01:34.326
Miss Gray: I sure did.

16
00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.964
She was terrific!!

17
00:01:37.965 --> 00:01:40.716
Miss Gray: Here. These are for you.

18
00:01:40.717 --> 00:01:47.138
Daisy: Flowers! They're so pretty. Thank you.

19
00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:50.012
Miss Gray: Thank you, Daisy.

20
00:01:50.013 --> 00:01:54.617
Miss Gray: Mrs. Dee told me all about Room Two last week.

21
00:01:54.618 --> 00:01:57.290
Daisy: She did?

22
00:01:57.291 --> 00:02:00.272
Jenna: Uh-oh . . .

23
00:02:00.273 --> 00:02:03.675
Miss Gray: And Mrs. Dee said that you were a big help.

24
00:02:03.676 --> 00:02:07.936
Daisy: Whew! I'm sorry about dancing during science.

25
00:02:07.937 --> 00:02:24.834
Miss Gray: I know. Now show me some of those dance moves again!

26
00:02:24.835 --> 00:02:30.678
Coby: Woo-hoo! Miss Gray is back!

27
00:02:30.679 --> 00:02:34.652
Eve: We thought you'd never come back, Miss Gray.

28
00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:43.790
Maya: It was terrible.

29
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:54.776
Daisy: Miss Gray.

30
00:02:54.777 --> 00:02:57.410
Eve: Can I sign your cast?

31
00:02:57.411 --> 00:02:58.889
Miss Gray: Sure.

32
00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:04.960
Kids: Me too!

33
00:03:04.961 --> 00:03:08.080
Coby: How did you break your ankle anyway?

34
00:03:08.081 --> 00:03:10.419
Miss Gray: I was doing my favorite thing.

35
00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:13.876
Miss Gray: Well, my favorite thing after teaching, of course.

36
00:03:13.877 --> 00:03:15.475
Daisy: What's that?

37
00:03:15.476 --> 00:03:22.343
Miss Gray: Dancing!
